:24870230). RNA-binding protein involved in modulation of mRNA transcription by Polymerase II (PubMed:16950395). Could also play a role in RNA transport (PubMed:24608264). (Microbial infection) In case of infection by influenza virus A (IVA), is involved in viral replication (PubMed:21900157)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}